        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you, that's not going to work!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, don't worry. These attacks hurt about as much as firecrackers!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You blocked my shots in advance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know where they're coming from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I do, I've already figured you out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, back off. I'm going to use 'that'!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Got it! I'll disrupt Mephisto's guards again, so make it quick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take this bit of my blood as a farewell gift, Reunion's 'Phantom Crossbowmen!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seethe, and blast apart their disguise!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
