        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're using your own blood as an incendiary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, do I look like some sort of caster to you? Only some egotistical newbie would go around committing arson like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, but this is just one of my fighting techniques. Show yourselves - you have nowhere to hide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_016",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Faust, my camouflage is gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Command, retreat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are those...?! When did Reunion hide snipers over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Multiple Reunion snipers have appeared, primarily in the 2nd floor of the east building and the 3rd floor of the south building!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Proceed with caution. They might have set up ambushes for us on the lower levels!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was the strange phenomenon in the building also caused by them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Clever, you used refraction to make themselves seem invisible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, you can't completely conceal your tracks, or make sudden movements without compromising the effect of your Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're quite smart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all because of our great intel. Now that you know the gig's up, you should surrender.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to continue fighting, I'll make you pay for the deaths of Ace and Scout. Hmph, I don't even care if you weren't involved, kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Faust, we still have ammunition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Retreat. We've already lost our intel advantage. I will keep them occupied. The rest of you, move immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_016",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why aren't you shooting her? Faust!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attack, my guards! Hurry! There are four of them, just four... and only three of them pose any threat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fight! Tear apart those sinners now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "With Dr. {@nickname}'s leadership, the three of us are more than enough to defeat all of you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention, those Infected who you harmed, who you robbed of their free will to the point of not even being people anymore...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even that scaled boy next to you might not side with you anymore. His thoughts are filled with sorrow and turmoil...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto, you are alone on this battlefield!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You can read my mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I just felt it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, you'd have no idea what I'm thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
