    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine, I can barely block his shots...! However, I won't be able to keep suppressing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_015"
    },
    {
        "text": "GRAAAAAAGHHH!! AAAARRRRGGHH!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto's Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "My control is slipping!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto, let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their reinforcements are wiping out our forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've never even seen some of them before. There's been a change in the plan. Our moves have been read.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Why haven't our forces come? We have over twenty squads and two major brigades, so why are none of them here still?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is Crownslayer? Or FrostNova?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't like Chernobog. We couldn't shut down the enemy's communications, so they were able to call lots of reinforcements and put up a vigorous resistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mephisto...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are they still not here yet?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mephisto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1508_Faust_1#1",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We won't know the reason unless we see it for ourselves. Let's get out of here first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Faust"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze, I'm about to reach my limit. Can you finish this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure thing. Just me and that Ch'en lady should suffice!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
