    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Blaze came to our aid in the knick of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was also a loud-mouthed L.G.D. officer just outside the ruined city...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It would've been easier if you had just helped us in the first place instead of watching from the sidelines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I was expecting you to say something like 'I didn't need Rhodes Island's help anyway,' or 'I'd rather die than work with them.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least you don't seem to be that stubborn. Is there anything else you'd like to say? If not, I'd like to head back to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I never knew Rhodes Island had an aircraft like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, we have a lot of things that might surprise you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like you, we don't want to play our entire hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not counting us as one of your cards, are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_3#1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, Madam Ch'en... there's an incoming transmission on a private line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Well done, Madam Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Madam Swire also on this channel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 2,
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Please report your progress.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 2,
        "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I bailed Rhodes Island out, and also finished arrangements for the various brigades. Coordinating and managing everything took me three full nights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about you, Madam Ch'en?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already taken back\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014with Rhodes Island's assistance, we've taken back the L.G.D. Headquarters. Their commander will spread word of their defeat through the ranks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Reunion forces left in Lungmen have been coralled into our ambush points using the routes we arranged for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Next, we just need to wait for their counterattack.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mission is now complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I've also received reports from a few of your other colleagues. All missions in the last phase have been completed flawlessly. Well done, all of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will now move onto the next phase.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
